/home/agentops/.pi/agent/npm/node_modules/pi-subagents/docs/extension-api.md:- The bridge is enabled only when Herdr supplies `HERDR_ENV=1` and `HERDR_PANE_ID`; outside Herdr it registers no listeners or timers.
